WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.988
Clop! Clop!

2
00:00:05.989 --> 00:00:08.159
Thump! Thump!

3
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.942
The box bumped up and down.

4
00:00:11.943 --> 00:00:22.380
"Where are we going?" Mittens whispered.

5
00:00:22.381 --> 00:00:36.368
"I don't know," Tom whispered back.

6
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:41.424
At last the box stopped.

7
00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:48.380
The kittens peeked out.

8
00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:52.650
"We are in town!" Tom said.

9
00:00:52.651 --> 00:00:58.859
He jumped out of the box.

10
00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:02.874
Tom ran down the road.

11
00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:06.723
His sisters ran after him.

12
00:01:06.724 --> 00:01:10.836
The town was very busy.

13
00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:18.093
People rushed past the kittens.

14
00:01:18.094 --> 00:01:23.263
Wagons and carts drove by.

15
00:01:23.264 --> 00:01:26.367
The town was noisy too.

16
00:01:26.368 --> 00:01:32.996
Bells rang and people laughed.

17
00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:36.553
Dogs barked and doors banged.

18
00:01:36.554 --> 00:01:45.410
"I'm scared," Mittens whispered.

19
00:01:45.411 --> 00:01:50.861
The kittens ran under a bench.

20
00:01:50.862 --> 00:01:54.301
"It's quiet here," Moppet said.

21
00:01:54.302 --> 00:01:56.723
"Let's rest."

22
00:01:56.724 --> 00:02:00.098
"I like this town," Tom said.

23
00:02:00.099 --> 00:02:02.755
"But it's too busy and noisy."

24
00:02:02.756 --> 00:02:05.372
Mittens nodded.

25
00:02:05.373 --> 00:02:09.876
"I want to go home," she said.

26
00:02:09.877 --> 00:02:12.733
The kittens looked one way.

27
00:02:12.734 --> 00:02:15.539
Then they looked another way.

28
00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:19.831
But all the roads looked the same.

29
00:02:19.832 --> 00:02:24.225
Mittens started to cry.

30
00:02:24.226 --> 00:02:27.532
"This is terrible!" she said.

31
00:02:27.533 --> 00:02:33.504
"We are lost!"

